  "usage_note": "Use **on** before a day: *on Sunday*. *On Sundays* means every Sunday. There is no preposition before **next**, **last**, **this**, or **every**: *last Sunday*. Some calendars show **Sunday** as the first day of the week and others as the last. The short written form is **Sun.**",
